{
    "title": "Botim - Video and Voice Call",
    "description": "Welcome to Botim - making your life easier and simpler \ud83d\ude4c \r\n\r\nBotim, the most loved and trusted communication platform has transformed into an ultra platform \ud83d\ude80. The new intuitive interface and advanced features aim at performing multiple tasks for you, offering you ease and convenience every day along with complete security. No matter where you stay in the world, you can interact, and share all you like with your loved ones. \ud83d\udc99 \r\n\r\nDownload Botim and make the most of the following services:\r\n\r\nBOTIM VOIP: Enjoy secure and private group video and voice calls; digital KYC; easy money transfers; built-in emoji dashboards; mobile recharges; bill payments; online games and much more! Get encrypted calling and messaging on 2G, 3G, 4G, 5G, and WiFi connections without using a VPN.\r\nConversations are secured with AES-256 encryption, allowing you to connect in a fast, secure, and reliable way.\r\n\r\nMAKE ENCRYPTED CALLS ACROSS BORDERS \ud83d\udcde\r\nWe're not just a Dubai video-calling app! Whether it's a free call to a country or a free call from another country, Botim lets you make secure and encrypted connections with people across the globe!\r\n\r\nCONNECT IN GROUP CHATS & CALLS \ud83d\udc6a \r\nBotim lets you join secure and private group chats with up to 500 contacts and make group video calls with up to 21 people at the same time!\r\n \r\nSEND MESSAGES AND FILES TO YOUR FRIENDS \ud83d\udcac\r\nChatting  on Botim is more fun than ever - share media, documents, files to your friends without any hassle!!\r\n\r\nMAKE PHONE PAYMENTS & RECHARGES\ud83d\udcb8\r\nNeed to pay an Etisalat bill? Have to make a mobile top-up? We've got you! Make secure bill payments and mobile recharges for every major network provider across the world, including:\r\nUAE: Etisalat, DU\r\nIndia: Airtel, Vodafone, BSL, Jio, MTL, Vi India, Pakistan: Telenor, Ufone, Warid, Zong, Jazz Philippines: Globe, Cherry Mobile, Smart (SunCellular)\r\nBangladesh: Teletalk, Robi, Banglalink, Airtel, Grameenphone\r\n\r\nBECOME A BOTIM VIP MEMBER\ud83c\udf1f\r\nSubscribe and upgrade to an ad-free experience with Botim\u2019s VIP Membership program! Get early access to upcoming features and enjoy higher network quality, HD calling, background blur, and an exclusive VIP badge on your Botim profile!\r\n\r\nBOTIM MONEY\ud83d\udcb0\r\nSending and Receiving money has never been this easy. With Botim\u2019s fast and secure International Money Transfer services, send money anytime, anywhere.\r\n\r\nInternational and Local Money Transfer:\r\nIf you're using Botim in the UAE, you can quickly and easily send money to your loved ones \ud83d\udc95. Experience the power of seamless, borderless money transfer across 170+ countries with Botim!\r\n\r\nBOTIM SMART \ud83e\udd13\r\nIntroducing Botim Smart, the all-in-one solution for government services, bill payments, and home services. With everything you need in one place and easy access from your phone, life is simple and easy. \r\n\r\nEmirates ID Issue and Renewal \ud83c\udd94\r\n\r\nWith just a few taps on your smartphone, and without visiting a government office, you can submit your application and receive your new Emirates ID within a few days. \r\n\r\nBOTIM STORES: Experience the best of intuitive conversational commerce\ud83d\uded2. From groceries to fashion, and electronics to home decor, you can have everything delivered to your doorstep in the most convenient of ways.\r\n\r\nBOTIM HOME: Your one-stop solution for all kinds of important services you could have asked for. Be it home services\ud83c\udfe0, pharmacy\ud83d\udc8a, or cleaning services\ud83e\uddf9, we've got you covered.\r\n\r\nCONNECT AND COMPETE IN ONLINE GAMES\r\nStay entertained with games \ud83c\udfaeon Botim! Connect with players in live voice chats!!\r\n\r\nQURAN KAREEM AT YOUR FINGERTIPS\r\nDiscover the Holy Quran with Botim! Use the explore section to access verses from the Holy Quran in HD quality \ud83d\udcd6 .\r\n*Operator data charges may apply.\r\n\r\nAll Fintech services provided by Botim are powered by Payby, a UAE Central Bank Licensed Entity\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://botim.me/terms #privacy\r\nTerms of Service: https://botim.me/terms/",
